    // DxGrid's @bind-SelectedDataItem / SelectedDataItemChanged
    // can silently fail to fire on plain POCO lists, so every
    // lookup grid here resolves the clicked row explicitly and
    // highlights it manually via CustomizeElement.
    // =====================================================

